Then compare the final reconstruction with the original.

Anything surviving that circuit is a candidate load-bearing invariant.

Anything appearing midway is a candidate discovery.

Anything disappearing tells us which representation was carrying information we failed to preserve.

And the route itself goes into Metamap.

That’s where I’d run the little bastard. Re-Mark becomes both an operator and an experimental instrument for discovering which representations expose which kinds of truth.